{"id":"en-sentences-intermediate","kind":"sentence","title":"회화 필수 문장 · 중급","description":"실제 대화에서 막히는 10가지 상황의 문장 100개 (한 → 영)","lang":"en-US","version":1,"source":"되새김 자체 제작","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","items":[{"id":"s2-work-01","situation":"직장·회의","ko":"회의 시작할까요?","en":"Shall we get started?","key":"get started"},{"id":"s2-work-02","situation":"직장·회의","ko":"확인해 보고 다시 알려 드릴게요.","en":"Let me check and get back to you.","key":"get back to you","note":"바로 답하기 어려울 때"},{"id":"s2-work-03","situation":"직장·회의","ko":"그 건은 제가 맡을게요.","en":"I'll take that on.","key":"take that on"},{"id":"s2-work-04","situation":"직장·회의","ko":"이번 주 금요일까지는 끝낼 수 있을 것 같아요.","en":"I should be able to finish it by this Friday.","key":"should be able to"},{"id":"s2-work-05","situation":"직장·회의","ko":"일정이 좀 빠듯해요.","en":"The schedule is a bit tight.","key":"a bit tight"},{"id":"s2-work-06","situation":"직장·회의","ko":"마감을 하루만 연장해 주실 수 있을까요?","en":"Could I get a one-day extension?","key":"extension"},{"id":"s2-work-07","situation":"직장·회의","ko":"이 건 지금 어디까지 진행됐어요?","en":"Where are we on this?","key":"Where are we on","note":"진행 상황을 물을 때"},{"id":"s2-work-08","situation":"직장·회의","ko":"요점만 말씀드릴게요.","en":"I'll get straight to the point.","key":"get straight to the point"},{"id":"s2-work-09","situation":"직장·회의","ko":"그건 다음 회의 때 다시 얘기하죠.","en":"Let's circle back to that at the next meeting.","key":"circle back","note":"회사에서 자주 쓰는 표현"},{"id":"s2-work-10","situation":"직장·회의","ko":"오늘은 여기까지 하죠.","en":"Let's call it a day.","key":"call it a day"},{"id":"s2-chat-01","situation":"근황·수다","ko":"요즘 뭐 하고 지냈어요?","en":"What have you been up to lately?","key":"What have you been up to"},{"id":"s2-chat-02","situation":"근황·수다","ko":"요즘 일에 치여 살아요.","en":"I've been swamped with work.","key":"swamped","note":"일이 산더미 같다"},{"id":"s2-chat-03","situation":"근황·수다","ko":"그냥 그럭저럭 지내요.","en":"Just getting by.","key":"getting by"},{"id":"s2-chat-04","situation":"근황·수다","ko":"무슨 일 있었어요? 다 말해 봐요.","en":"What happened? Tell me everything.","key":"Tell me everything"},{"id":"s2-chat-05","situation":"근황·수다","ko":"그 소식 들었어요?","en":"Have you heard the news?","key":"Have you heard"},{"id":"s2-chat-06","situation":"근황·수다","ko":"말도 마요, 진짜 최악이었어요.","en":"Don't even get me started. It was the worst.","key":"Don't even get me started"},{"id":"s2-chat-07","situation":"근황·수다","ko":"그거 완전 제 취향이에요.","en":"That's right up my alley.","key":"right up my alley"},{"id":"s2-chat-08","situation":"근황·수다","ko":"요즘 그 드라마에 푹 빠졌어요.","en":"I'm hooked on that show.","key":"hooked on"},{"id":"s2-chat-09","situation":"근황·수다","ko":"시간 가는 줄 몰랐네요.","en":"I lost track of time.","key":"lost track of time"},{"id":"s2-chat-10","situation":"근황·수다","ko":"조만간 또 만나서 얘기해요.","en":"Let's catch up again soon.","key":"catch up"},{"id":"s2-care-01","situation":"공감·위로","ko":"정말 힘들었겠어요.","en":"That must have been really hard.","key":"must have been"},{"id":"s2-care-02","situation":"공감·위로","ko":"그 기분 알아요.","en":"I know how you feel.","key":"how you feel"},{"id":"s2-care-03","situation":"공감·위로","ko":"너무 자책하지 마요.","en":"Don't be so hard on yourself.","key":"hard on yourself"},{"id":"s2-care-04","situation":"공감·위로","ko":"최선을 다했잖아요.","en":"You did your best.","key":"did your best"},{"id":"s2-care-05","situation":"공감·위로","ko":"필요하면 언제든 말해요, 내가 있잖아요.","en":"I'm here if you need me.","key":"here if you need me"},{"id":"s2-care-06","situation":"공감·위로","ko":"다 잘될 거예요.","en":"Everything will work out.","key":"work out"},{"id":"s2-care-07","situation":"공감·위로","ko":"시간이 약이에요.","en":"Time heals all wounds.","key":"heals"},{"id":"s2-care-08","situation":"공감·위로","ko":"그런 일을 겪었다니 정말 안됐어요.","en":"I'm so sorry you had to go through that.","key":"go through"},{"id":"s2-care-09","situation":"공감·위로","ko":"그럴 수도 있죠.","en":"It happens.","key":"It happens","note":"실수한 사람을 안심시킬 때"},{"id":"s2-care-10","situation":"공감·위로","ko":"잘했어요, 정말 자랑스러워요.","en":"You did great. I'm so proud of you.","key":"proud of you"},{"id":"s2-opin-01","situation":"의견·조율","ko":"저는 좀 다르게 봐요.","en":"I see it a little differently.","key":"see it a little differently","note":"반대 의견을 부드럽게"},{"id":"s2-opin-02","situation":"의견·조율","ko":"무슨 말인지는 알겠는데요…","en":"I see your point, but...","key":"I see your point"},{"id":"s2-opin-03","situation":"의견·조율","ko":"그건 상황에 따라 달라요.","en":"It depends on the situation.","key":"It depends"},{"id":"s2-opin-04","situation":"의견·조율","ko":"서로 조금씩 양보하는 게 어때요?","en":"How about we meet halfway?","key":"meet halfway"},{"id":"s2-opin-05","situation":"의견·조율","ko":"솔직히 별로 안 끌려요.","en":"To be honest, I'm not really feeling it.","key":"not really feeling it"},{"id":"s2-opin-06","situation":"의견·조율","ko":"그 말도 일리가 있네요.","en":"You have a point there.","key":"You have a point"},{"id":"s2-opin-07","situation":"의견·조율","ko":"제가 틀렸을 수도 있지만요…","en":"I could be wrong, but...","key":"I could be wrong"},{"id":"s2-opin-08","situation":"의견·조율","ko":"그건 생각 못 해 봤네요.","en":"I hadn't thought of that.","key":"hadn't thought of"},{"id":"s2-opin-09","situation":"의견·조율","ko":"우리 생각이 같은지 확인하고 싶어서요.","en":"I just want to make sure we're on the same page.","key":"on the same page"},{"id":"s2-opin-10","situation":"의견·조율","ko":"좋은 지적이에요.","en":"That's a good point.","key":"good point"},{"id":"s2-ask-01","situation":"부탁·거절","ko":"잠깐 시간 되면 좀 도와줄래요?","en":"If you have a minute, could you help me out?","key":"help me out"},{"id":"s2-ask-02","situation":"부탁·거절","ko":"귀찮게 해서 미안한데요…","en":"Sorry to bother you, but...","key":"Sorry to bother you"},{"id":"s2-ask-03","situation":"부탁·거절","ko":"이번엔 빠져야 할 것 같아요.","en":"I'm afraid I'll have to pass this time.","key":"have to pass"},{"id":"s2-ask-04","situation":"부탁·거절","ko":"고맙지만 괜찮아요.","en":"Thanks, but I'm good.","key":"I'm good","note":"권유를 거절할 때"},{"id":"s2-ask-05","situation":"부탁·거절","ko":"하룻밤 생각해 볼게요.","en":"Let me sleep on it.","key":"sleep on it"},{"id":"s2-ask-06","situation":"부탁·거절","ko":"지금은 좀 곤란해요.","en":"Now's not a good time.","key":"not a good time"},{"id":"s2-ask-07","situation":"부탁·거절","ko":"다음에 하죠.","en":"Maybe some other time.","key":"some other time"},{"id":"s2-ask-08","situation":"부탁·거절","ko":"무리한 부탁인 건 알지만요…","en":"I know it's a lot to ask, but...","key":"a lot to ask"},{"id":"s2-ask-09","situation":"부탁·거절","ko":"이 정도는 해 드려야죠.","en":"That's the least I can do.","key":"the least I can do"},{"id":"s2-ask-10","situation":"부탁·거절","ko":"최고예요. 꼭 갚을게요.","en":"You're the best. I'll make it up to you.","key":"make it up to you"},{"id":"s2-fix-01","situation":"문제·불만","ko":"주문한 게 아직 안 왔어요.","en":"My order still hasn't arrived.","key":"still hasn't arrived"},{"id":"s2-fix-02","situation":"문제·불만","ko":"이거 뭔가 이상한 것 같아요.","en":"I think something's wrong with this.","key":"something's wrong with"},{"id":"s2-fix-03","situation":"문제·불만","ko":"결제가 두 번 된 것 같아요.","en":"I think I was charged twice.","key":"charged twice"},{"id":"s2-fix-04","situation":"문제·불만","ko":"생각했던 거랑 달라요.","en":"This isn't what I expected.","key":"what I expected"},{"id":"s2-fix-05","situation":"문제·불만","ko":"이 문제 어떻게 해결할 수 있을까요?","en":"How can we sort this out?","key":"sort this out"},{"id":"s2-fix-06","situation":"문제·불만","ko":"담당자분과 얘기할 수 있을까요?","en":"Could I speak to someone in charge?","key":"in charge"},{"id":"s2-fix-07","situation":"문제·불만","ko":"환불이나 교환 가능할까요?","en":"Is it possible to get a refund or an exchange?","key":"refund or an exchange"},{"id":"s2-fix-08","situation":"문제·불만","ko":"이런 일이 벌써 세 번째예요.","en":"This is the third time this has happened.","key":"the third time"},{"id":"s2-fix-09","situation":"문제·불만","ko":"30분 넘게 기다리고 있어요.","en":"I've been waiting for over thirty minutes.","key":"I've been waiting"},{"id":"s2-fix-10","situation":"문제·불만","ko":"빨리 처리해 주시면 감사하겠어요.","en":"I'd appreciate it if you could sort it out quickly.","key":"I'd appreciate it if","note":"정중하게 요구할 때"},{"id":"s2-plan-01","situation":"일정 변경","ko":"미안한데, 약속을 좀 미뤄야 할 것 같아요.","en":"Sorry, but I need to push back our plans.","key":"push back"},{"id":"s2-plan-02","situation":"일정 변경","ko":"일이 좀 생겨서요.","en":"Something came up.","key":"Something came up"},{"id":"s2-plan-03","situation":"일정 변경","ko":"시간을 조금 앞당길 수 있을까요?","en":"Could we move it up a bit?","key":"move it up"},{"id":"s2-plan-04","situation":"일정 변경","ko":"저 빼고 먼저 시작하세요.","en":"Go ahead and start without me.","key":"start without me"},{"id":"s2-plan-05","situation":"일정 변경","ko":"그날은 선약이 있어요.","en":"I have a prior commitment that day.","key":"prior commitment"},{"id":"s2-plan-06","situation":"일정 변경","ko":"몇 시쯤 도착해요?","en":"What's your ETA?","key":"ETA","note":"도착 예정 시간 (estimated time of arrival)"},{"id":"s2-plan-07","situation":"일정 변경","ko":"차가 막혀서 꼼짝도 못 하고 있어요.","en":"I'm stuck in traffic.","key":"stuck in traffic"},{"id":"s2-plan-08","situation":"일정 변경","ko":"계획이 무산됐어요.","en":"Our plans fell through.","key":"fell through"},{"id":"s2-plan-09","situation":"일정 변경","ko":"그냥 그때 상황 봐서 해요.","en":"Let's just play it by ear.","key":"play it by ear"},{"id":"s2-plan-10","situation":"일정 변경","ko":"저는 아무 때나 괜찮아요. 편한 시간 알려 줘요.","en":"I'm flexible. Just let me know what works for you.","key":"what works for you"},{"id":"s2-health-01","situation":"건강·병원","ko":"몸이 좀 안 좋아요.","en":"I'm feeling a bit under the weather.","key":"under the weather"},{"id":"s2-health-02","situation":"건강·병원","ko":"뭔가 걸리려나 봐요.","en":"I think I'm coming down with something.","key":"coming down with"},{"id":"s2-health-03","situation":"건강·병원","ko":"어제부터 열이 나요.","en":"I've had a fever since yesterday.","key":"since yesterday"},{"id":"s2-health-04","situation":"건강·병원","ko":"목이 칼칼해요.","en":"My throat feels scratchy.","key":"scratchy"},{"id":"s2-health-05","situation":"건강·병원","ko":"여기를 누르면 아파요.","en":"It hurts when I press here.","key":"It hurts when"},{"id":"s2-health-06","situation":"건강·병원","ko":"이 약은 얼마나 자주 먹어야 해요?","en":"How often should I take this medicine?","key":"How often should I"},{"id":"s2-health-07","situation":"건강·병원","ko":"부작용 있나요?","en":"Are there any side effects?","key":"side effects"},{"id":"s2-health-08","situation":"건강·병원","ko":"요즘 잠을 잘 못 자요.","en":"I haven't been sleeping well lately.","key":"sleeping well"},{"id":"s2-health-09","situation":"건강·병원","ko":"오늘 병가 낼게요.","en":"I'm going to call in sick today.","key":"call in sick"},{"id":"s2-health-10","situation":"건강·병원","ko":"많이 나아졌어요.","en":"I'm feeling much better.","key":"much better"},{"id":"s2-trip-01","situation":"여행 돌발 상황","ko":"비행기를 놓쳤어요.","en":"I missed my flight.","key":"missed my flight"},{"id":"s2-trip-02","situation":"여행 돌발 상황","ko":"다음 비행기 탈 수 있을까요?","en":"Can I get on the next flight?","key":"next flight"},{"id":"s2-trip-03","situation":"여행 돌발 상황","ko":"지갑을 잃어버렸어요.","en":"I lost my wallet.","key":"lost my wallet"},{"id":"s2-trip-04","situation":"여행 돌발 상황","ko":"가장 가까운 경찰서가 어디예요?","en":"Where's the nearest police station?","key":"police station"},{"id":"s2-trip-05","situation":"여행 돌발 상황","ko":"예약한 방이 아니에요.","en":"This isn't the room I booked.","key":"the room I booked"},{"id":"s2-trip-06","situation":"여행 돌발 상황","ko":"에어컨이 안 돼요.","en":"The air conditioning isn't working.","key":"isn't working"},{"id":"s2-trip-07","situation":"여행 돌발 상황","ko":"캐리어가 파손됐어요.","en":"My suitcase got damaged.","key":"got damaged"},{"id":"s2-trip-08","situation":"여행 돌발 상황","ko":"아직 시차 적응이 안 됐어요.","en":"I'm still jet-lagged.","key":"jet-lagged"},{"id":"s2-trip-09","situation":"여행 돌발 상황","ko":"여기 영어 하시는 분 계세요?","en":"Does anyone here speak English?","key":"speak English"},{"id":"s2-trip-10","situation":"여행 돌발 상황","ko":"대사관에 연락해야 할 것 같아요.","en":"I think I need to contact my embassy.","key":"contact my embassy"},{"id":"s2-cheer-01","situation":"칭찬·축하","ko":"승진 축하해요, 그럴 자격 있어요.","en":"Congrats on your promotion. You deserve it.","key":"You deserve it"},{"id":"s2-cheer-02","situation":"칭찬·축하","ko":"정말 잘 어울려요.","en":"That looks great on you.","key":"looks great on you","note":"옷·머리 등을 칭찬할 때"},{"id":"s2-cheer-03","situation":"칭찬·축하","ko":"정말 대단하네요!","en":"That's impressive!","key":"impressive"},{"id":"s2-cheer-04","situation":"칭찬·축하","ko":"덕분에 오늘 기분 최고예요.","en":"You made my day.","key":"made my day"},{"id":"s2-cheer-05","situation":"칭찬·축하","ko":"그동안 고생한 보람이 있네요.","en":"All your hard work paid off.","key":"paid off"},{"id":"s2-cheer-06","situation":"칭찬·축하","ko":"칭찬해 줘서 고마워요.","en":"Thanks, I appreciate the compliment.","key":"appreciate the compliment"},{"id":"s2-cheer-07","situation":"칭찬·축하","ko":"과찬이에요.","en":"You're too kind.","key":"too kind"},{"id":"s2-cheer-08","situation":"칭찬·축하","ko":"잘됐다! 진짜 기뻐요.","en":"That's great news! I'm so happy for you.","key":"happy for you"},{"id":"s2-cheer-09","situation":"칭찬·축하","ko":"이건 축하해야죠!","en":"This calls for a celebration!","key":"calls for a celebration"},{"id":"s2-cheer-10","situation":"칭찬·축하","ko":"당신 아니었으면 못 했을 거예요.","en":"I couldn't have done it without you.","key":"couldn't have done it without you"}]}